      "content": "hey, i'm working on a sociology paper about the \"myth of meritocracy\" and was wondering if you could help me out. can you summarize the most compelling arguments that suggest things like IQ and standardized testing aren't actually valid measures of \"merit\" in a social context? i need to flesh out that specific section of my paper.",
