      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. can you go a bit deeper into the idea of cultural bias in these tests? like, how exactly do critics say they're failing to be objective? i'm looking for specifics on why the results are seen as more of a reflection of social standing than actual potential.",
